            "richTextValue" : "<div style=\"padding-right:1rem;padding-left:1rem\">\n    <p style=\"color:#006eb3;padding-bottom:0.5rem\"><b>Proof of Performance: Deal Win Claims</b></p>\n<p>Please upload and submit documentation evidencing Customer’s (i.e. your) success in winning the submitted Project/Deal/Opportunity.  Acceptable forms of evidence include, but are not limited to:</p>\n<br/>\n<ul>\n    <li>Invoice from you to End Customer (redacted as necessary) verifying shipment or purchase, quantities, and family types for approved products.</li>\n\t<li>Direct communication from the end customer verifying quantities & products (for the first 12 months)</li>\n\t<li>Non-confidential communications from End Customer to Customer indicating award of business to Customer.</li>\n\t<li>RFQ outcome</li>\n</ul>\n    <br/>\n<p><i>\nNDA: Intel respects your confidentiality obligations with your partners. Please do not submit to Intel any documents that would breach those obligations. Please reach out to Intel if a multiparty NDA is required.\n</i></p>\n</div>"
